      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kirkland%2C_Washington"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Kirkland Arts Center sits in the historic Peter Kirk Building on Market Street, offering classes and community gallery space.",
